<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT sets dividend for preferred shares.</title>
<headline>PLDT sets dividend for preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co said on Tuesday its board had approved a resolution paying fifty centavo cash dividend to shareholders of preferred shares series B, F, Q and V.</p>
<p>Shareholders as of February 27 are eligible for the dividend, which will be paid on March 31.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
